@ audio-tone.s, assembled with arm-none-eabi-as -march=armv4t into the text form the tests read.
@ One word per token, little-endian in memory, offsets from the image base. The disassembly beside
@ each word is arm-none-eabi-objdump's. Regenerate with the commands in audio-tone.s.
@ _start:
ea000006   @ 000 b 20 <reset>
eafffffe   @ 004 b 4 <P_END>
eafffffe   @ 008 b 8 <P_SEG>
eafffffe   @ 00c b c <P_CMD>
